    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Novel Simulator</strong></i> is an interactive fiction game where you play as both the <strong>author</strong> and the <strong>protagonist</strong> of your own story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Role:</strong> Write the story as the <strong>creator</strong>, then live it as the <strong>main character</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-Blending Worlds:</strong> Experience <strong>cultivation, fantasy, sci-fi\u00a0</strong>settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Book-Style Interaction:</strong> Flip through chapters like a novel, with customizable fonts and themes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Story:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your genre, identity, personality, and special ability.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tags</strong> shape your protagonist and unlock unique story paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Choices:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>author</strong>, pick the next chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>hero</strong>, face the consequences\u2014<strong>glory, death, or stagnation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reader feedback</strong>  affects your novel\u2019s rating.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endings &amp; Ratings:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>endings</strong> based on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final score: From <strong>&quot;Trash&quot; to &quot;Masterpiece&quot;</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> for exploring different builds and hidden outcomes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Novel Simulator</strong></i> is an interactive fiction game where you play as both the <strong>author</strong> and the <strong>protagonist</strong> of your own story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Role:</strong> Write the story as the <strong>creator</strong>, then live it as the <strong>main character</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-Blending Worlds:</strong> Experience <strong>cultivation, fantasy, sci-fi\u00a0</strong>settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Book-Style Interaction:</strong> Flip through chapters like a novel, with customizable fonts and themes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Story:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your genre, identity, personality, and special ability.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tags</strong> shape your protagonist and unlock unique story paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Choices:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>author</strong>, pick the next chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the <strong>hero</strong>, face the consequences\u2014<strong>glory, death, or stagnation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reader feedback</strong>  affects your novel\u2019s rating.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endings &amp; Ratings:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>endings</strong> based on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final score: From <strong>&quot;Trash&quot; to &quot;Masterpiece&quot;</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> for exploring different builds and hidden outcomes.</p></li></ul>",
